{
	"$comment": [
		"Synthetic repository indexes, one per adapted extension format, used by",
		"client-web/src/lib/plugins/foreign/*.spec.ts and available to any second",
		"implementation of the same adapters.",
		"",
		"Every host here is example.invalid or example.com, which RFC 2606 and RFC",
		"6761 reserve. AGENTS.md rule 9 forbids a real content source appearing in",
		"this repository at all, and a fixture is exactly the place that rule gets",
		"broken by accident: a URL that was convenient for one afternoon's testing",
		"is a URL in the history forever. These are hand-written to the shape of",
		"each format, never captured from a live repository.",
		"",
		"The shapes themselves are documented in contract/plugin-api/FOREIGN.md."
	],
